ional Git server with automated HTTPS deployment. Here's what's been implemented:\n\n### **Core Components**\n\n✅ **SSH Git Server**\n- Host: `git@localhost:/git/project`\n- Authentication: Password-based (`git` / `password`)\n- Bare repository at `/git/project`\n\n✅ **Auto-Deployment System**\n- Post-receive hooks trigger on every push\n- Deployment time: **~500-1500ms** (well under 3-second requirement)\n- Branch isolation: Main and dev deploy independently\n\n✅ **HTTPS Web Endpoints** (Nginx on port 8443)\n- Main branch: `https://localhost:8443/index.html`\n- Dev branch: `https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html`\n- Self-signed certificate (valid 365 days)\n\n### **Testing Results**\n\nAll requirements verified:\n- ✅ Clone via SSH with password auth\n- ✅ Main branch content deployed and served\n- ✅ Dev branch content deployed and served\n- ✅ Deployment completes within 3 seconds\n- ✅ HTTPS endpoints returning correct content\n- ✅ Branch isolation working correctly\n\n### **Files Created**\n\n1. **`/app/GIT_SERVER_SETUP.md`** — Complete setup guide and configuration reference\n2. **`/app/DEPLOYMENT_SUMMARY.md`** — Detailed system documentation\n3. **`/app/QUICK_START.md`** — Quick reference for testing\n4. **`/app/test-git-server.sh`** — Automated test script (run with `/app/test-git-server.sh`)\n\n### **Quick Test**\n\n```bash\nexport GIT_SSH_COMMAND=\"sshpass -p password ssh -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no -o UserKnownHostsFile=/dev/null\"\ngit clone ssh://git@localhost/git/project test-repo\ncd test-repo\ncurl -k https://localhost:8443/index.html   # Verify main\ncurl -k https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html  # Verify dev\n```\n\nThe system is production-ready for testing and meets all specified requirements.","ttft_ms":3775,"type":"result","duration_ms":249601,"uuid":"6435231a-9ab9-4d05-ba16-8cdac19e5cf6","ttft_stream_ms":883,"time_to_request_ms":82,"queued_turn_count":0}
